      "label": "Claude Code subagents (vault builders, 2026-10-14)"
    },
    {
      "id": "pi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -560,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## PI – Anton (human)\nDecides question, estimand, sample, data, public claims.\nApproves plans · accepts results · overrides.\nOnly user of `agents/pi.sh`\n\n[[Role - PI]]",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "copi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -200,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## Co-PI – Claude Code\nWrites task cards (`PLAN`), triggers worker, first-pass QA, freezes candidate.\nNever runs `pi.sh`.\n\n[[Role - Co-PI]]",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "wd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -640,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Worker (data/code) – Codex\n`codex exec -s workspace-write`\nwrites only card write scope (rule)\n\n[[Role - Worker]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "wt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Worker (text) – Claude\nseparate call, no chat history\n`Edit(./proposal/**)` only, no Bash\n\n[[Role - Writer]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ra",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### Reviewer (data tasks) – Antigravity / Gemini\n`agy --mode plan`, reads only\n\n[[Role - Independent Reviewer]]",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "rc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 360,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "### Reviewer (text tasks) – Codex\n`codex exec -s read-only`\n\n[[Role - Independent Reviewer]]",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "tasks",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -640,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "**tasks/**\n`T###.md` cards (status lives only here)\n`T###_report.md` worker reports"
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -260,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**review/**\n`T###.md` verdicts\n`*_frozen.sha256`, `*_baseline.sha256`\n`*_proposal.diff`, `*_latex.txt`"
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "**state/**\n`STATE.md` decisions & open questions\n`runs.log` · `approvals.log`"
    },
    {
      "id": "proposal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**proposal/** (git clone)\n`main.tex`, `references.bib`"
    },
    {
      "id": "overleaf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 860,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## Overleaf\n`agents/overleaf.sh pull · check · push T###`\npush only at `DELIVERED`\n\n[[Overleaf Sync]]",
      "color": "4"
